  "statuteText": "261:123 Registration and Plates. –\n\nAny person who has an established place of business and who is engaged in the business of buying secondhand motor vehicles for the purpose of remodeling, taking apart, or rebuilding the same, or buying or selling parts of secondhand motor vehicles, or tires, or assembling secondhand motor vehicle parts, may be granted a motor vehicle junk registration and plates upon satisfying the director that such applicant is a suitable person to hold such registration."
